WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
The swordfish pursues a continuously swimming school. The fish beat their tails and accelerate away.

00:03.800 --> 00:06.500
The school scatters. A target fish keeps fleeing to the right as the swordfish closes the gap and sweeps its bill into the fish's path.

00:06.500 --> 00:09.700
The intercepted fish is held on the bill. The close-up shows a dramatized impalement, not a claim of typical swordfish feeding.

00:09.700 --> 00:10.500
The swordfish withdraws its bill, releasing the stunned fish.

00:10.500 --> 00:12.600
The released prey drifts independently. The swordfish changes course and catches up to it.

00:12.600 --> 00:12.900
The mouth reaches the fish before it disappears.

00:12.900 --> 00:14.000
The remaining school continues swimming out of view. This is an illustrative AI reconstruction.
